<title>CANADA: Zaire mission still on despite refugee move - Canada.</title>
<headline>Zaire mission still on despite refugee move - Canada.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plans for an international humanitarian rescue mission in central Africa will proceed despite a mass return of Rwandan refugees, a spokeswoman for Canadian Prime Minister Jean Chretien said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's all systems go. We're still continuing with the plans for the mission as planned,&quot; spokeswoman Leslie Swartman told Reuters. &quot;It certainly doesn't mean there's an end to the crisis there.&quot;</p>
</text>
